  "marketing_title_raw": "14k Solid Rose and White Gold Genuine Russian style Diamond Earrings Ring",
  "short_name": "Russian style Diamond Ring & Earring in 14k Gold",
  "long_description_raw": "Imperial and elegant. This solid 14k gold ring and earrings are created in a Victorian inspired, old Russian design. Sparkling 27 diamonds totaling 2.28ct. are set in white gold and a rose gold ring and earrings. Sturdy french leverback locks provide a secure fit. Traditionally presented to your bride to be, today this ring can be worn for any occasion.\nThis is a brand new item and is manufactured on our premises.\n You are buying this item from the NYC Diamond District.\nSizes available: 4 to 9.1/2 in full, half & quarter sizes. \n Item will be shipped within 3-5 business days after payment is cleared.\nAvailable in any Stone you Like Please ask for the Price,\nA Company Appraisal Is Included With Your Purchase.\nAGI Appraisal Available: Value $5,000.00 + $75\n Retail Replacement and Appraisal Value $5,000.00 \nOrder By Phone: 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. \n 1.800.548. 0411. or 1 917.488.1146 \n100% Satisfaction Guaranteed.\nOur Warranty: A full year on workmanship!\nНаши телефоны: 1 800 548 0411 - 1-917 488 1146 Приём заказов круглосуточно\nпо телефону или через Интернет.",
